comment.body:
@szybia Thanks for your review, I removed the dead code branch you noticed. 

The cause of the test failure in the final assertBusy that timed out seems caused by the BCCs created during the target's recovery (generations 18/19) that are registered by the search shard during recovery. They are only released once it replies to an inactivity-monitor commit notification and under CI load it seems that it can take more than 10s (the assertBusy tmeout).

So I added an explicit inactivity monitor execution in the assertBusy and also bumped the timeout to 30s. I kept the other change for FAIL_SOURCE so that it also waits for PIT contexts to be freed (which is done asynchronously when the source shard closes).
